WEBVTT

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.930
It feels <i>so</i> good!

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.560
What the...?

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.590
Breast pads.

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.560
A wondrous invention that 
makes your bosom look bigger.

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:51.190
Now! Two squeezes remain.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.230
And now! The final fondling!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.460
There, done! All done!

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:12.390
What did you think? Was it not fantastic?

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:16.370
How lucky for you, to grasp 
such splendorous things!

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:18.470
And now we are even!

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:23.090
With Meowy saved, I have no real reason 
to hunt devils any longer,

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:24.730
<i>There's lots of stuff I could say, but... Huh?</i>

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:25.480
yet there's no escaping Makima!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:28.040
So I will aid you all with your duty!

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.810
I'm sure the pleasure is all yours!

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:33.930
Meowy! Off to bed we go!

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.520
<i>That's it?</i>

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:21.570
This is good!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.290
Seconds would be splendid!

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:26.590
I'll eat yours, if you won't have it!

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:27.220
You little...!

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:30.230
Where shall we slaughter devils today?

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:32.930
Hey.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.190
Hey!

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:37.890
Hey!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:39.240
Chop!

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:44.740
This is the form apology 
for the damage to the buildings.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:48.630
This is for verifying 
the disposal of the devils' bodies.

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:52.090
Then there's this, from the Ministry of Land, 
Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.250
You'll need to stamp it, here and here.

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:03.670
I hate making you do all this paperwork.

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:07.510
It's almost like killing 
the Bat Devil was a bad thing.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:13.020
Is something bothering you, Denji?

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.020
Y'know, I...

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:21.510
There's something I was chasing after, 
and I finally managed to get it.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.020
But once I did, it wasn't...

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.780
as big of a deal as I thought.

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:35.080
Now I'm wondering, if I go after 
something else, and get my hands on it,

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:41.020
am I just gonna think 
I was happier during the chase?

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:46.700
That's, like... total bullshit, isn't it?

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.060
What exactly are you talking about, Denji?

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:57.560
I touched boobs for the first time,
 but it wasn't that great.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:08.700
Denji...

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:10.700
I believe that, when it comes to sex,

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:16.870
the better you understand 
the other person, the better it feels.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:24.080
But it's hard to understand 
how someone else feels.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:29.220
So, start with observing 
the hand, carefully.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:34.350
How long are their fingers?

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:40.740
Are their palms cold?

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:42.830
Are they warm?

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:46.100
What's the shape of their ears?

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.490
Ever had your finger bitten?

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:54.750
B-Bit...?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.100
Remember this.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.910
So that even if you can't see,

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:05.760
you'll be able to tell it's me, 
from how hard I'm biting.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:08.690
Memorize it.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.520
I... got it.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.050
Denji...

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.060
I'd like to ask you to do something for me.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:06:59.940
Can I?

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.190
Yeah.

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:11.120
I want you to beat the Gun Devil.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.500
Gun Devil?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:20.550
It appeared in America 13 years ago, 
but nobody knows where it is now.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:26.340
It's a very strong devil 
that all hunters want to kill.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:32.250
But I happen to think that you can kill it.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:37.600
Because you're not like any 
of the other Devil Hunters.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.980
And if you're able to kill the Gun Devil,

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:46.810
I'll make any wish of yours come true.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:52.480
You're saying if your Denji
 kills the Gun Devil,

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:57.240
Miss Makima's gonna make 
any wish of his come true?

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:02.730
So... like, I mean...

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.630
You're saying if your Denji
 kills the Gun Devil,

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:09.510
Miss Makima's gonna make 
<i>any</i> wish of his come true?

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:17.470
<i>Anything</i>, like... even se—

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.770
I said anything, Denji.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:23.520
Holy shit! Is that even allowed?!

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.580
It's only allowed because this devil 
is so strong and bad, mind you.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:31.470
People were trying to profit off of guns

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:33.980
as a counter-measure against 
devils across the world,

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:37.040
which resulted in an increase 
in crime and conflict.

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:41.210
The news focused on it 
non-stop for a while,

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:45.250
with people more afraid 
of gun violence than ever.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:50.670
Then a major armed terrorist 
attack happened in America.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.270
That was the day the Gun Devil appeared.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:03.890
"This is where I live," said the city mouse.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:03.890
<b>The Country Mouse and the City Mouse</b>

