00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.410
And, oh what a big house it was!

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.270
The city mouse's family—

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:10.270
Dad!

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.860
Let's play catch outside.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:17.210
Taiyo doesn't feel well. 
Find something you can play by yourself.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:19.410
He never does.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.290
I don't remember him feeling good.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:25.290
You're the older brother. 
Be good and play by yourself.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:28.220
I...

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.800
I wanna play with him.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.390
Quit following me.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:59.490
You're so annoying... I said cut it out!

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:05.220
I'm gonna play by myself.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:12.980
Gotcha!

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:17.920
Stupid! I said cut it out!

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:27.930
It's cold...

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:37.710
If you catch a cold, 
I'm gonna get in trouble.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:43.380
Your hands won't get cold 
if we play catch, right?

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:46.060
Go grab a glove from the house.

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:49.440
Yes!

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:15.680
In a little under five minutes, 
1.2 million people were killed.

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:20.010
The Gun Devil hasn't been seen since.

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:30.360
Fear of devils across the board 
increased as a result,

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:35.270
making them all stronger than ever before.

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:42.490
Gun control got a lot more severe 
in an attempt to weaken the Gun Devil...

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:46.890
Along with increased censorship of the news.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.650
I'm not sure I understand, but...

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:53.650
Let's say this thing's so strong, 
it's hard to understand.

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:56.650
Do you think you can beat it, Denji?

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:59.400
Well... I'd say...

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.370
If I bust out all the stops,

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:05.170
it'll be a <i>peace</i> of cake.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.780
In that case...

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:10.370
First, we'll need to actually 
find the Gun Devil.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.460
How exactly are we gonna do that, anyway?

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:18.580
These are pieces of the Gun Devil 
that we've collected.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:22.770
It's so fast, pieces of it 
are torn off just from moving.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.720
If a devil eats some of this,

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:30.240
no matter what their nature, 
they become more powerful.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:31.810
See how they stick together?

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:36.740
Because of how powerful the Gun Devil is,

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:39.590
once the chunks of flesh 
reach a certain size,

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:42.880
they start to be attracted 
to the original body.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:46.450
So if we can make this piece bigger,

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.610
it'll lead us to the Gun Devil.

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.500
Got one.

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:57.500
So it really was snacking 
on a piece of the Gun.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:01.790
Explains how such 
a wimpy devil got so strong.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.740
But did it find that piece, 
or did someone serve it up?

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:10.390
Doesn't change what our job is.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.770
We keep killing devils,

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:17.790
and eventually, we'll find him.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.150
Public Safety's received a request 
for devil extermination.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.160
A devil has been spotted inside of a hotel.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.840
No confirmation on the status 
of the hotel's guests.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:34.590
Several of the civilian devil hunters 
who initially went in have been found dead.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:39.180
It's believed the target has 
consumed a piece of the Gun Devil.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:44.280
We're sending six agents from Public Safety 
Devil Extermination Special Division 4.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.180
It's hiding somewhere in this hotel.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.310
And this is no ordinary devil.

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:57.010
It's eaten a piece of the Gun Devil's flesh.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.190
Maybe it's the Gun Devil for real?

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:05.820
The more flesh, the stronger the attraction. 
The reaction's not big enough.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:08.200
Huh, guess not.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.950
How amusing... Give that thing to me!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:15.450
I thought I told you two 
to work on your manners.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:21.840
Who the hell's gonna suck up 
to you for no reason?

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.840
How foolish and conceited these humans be!

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.020
Mr. Hayakawa.

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.260
Sir.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.480
Good.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.690
Sweet!

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:32.640
Dude, he's so easy.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:33.760
Hayakawa!

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:37.270
Considering we're about 
to fight some devils...

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:40.020
Can we really trust these two 
to watch our backs?

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:43.420
One's a Fiend, and the other is some punk...

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:45.710
I'm not sure about this.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.200
We can't let them watch our backs.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:53.430
On extermination missions, 
they'll be taking point.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:57.420
If they try to run 
or switch sides, we kill them.

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:00.040
You're treating us like livestock!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.670
You two don't get rights.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:06.040
He's super pissed.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:07.570
Must be from this morning.

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:10.050
Perhaps our prank went too far?

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.370
You call that a prank?! I could kill you!

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:15.560
Yikes! What happened?

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:19.770
Aki, you can't just be harsh 
all the time, y'know?

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:23.740
She's right! The bat almost killed me, 
and now there's more work?!

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:24.940
I want a reward!

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.950
Got it! I'll take one for the team.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.860
Whoever kills this devil will win...

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:35.990
a kiss on the cheek from yours truly!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:41.460
That's... You shouldn't do that!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.710
A young woman who's not married 
shouldn't be so... indecent!

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:48.100
But doesn't a reward help with motivation?

00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:49.710
Right?

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.420
I'm not gonna sweat the kisses.

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:04.230
Don't worry about it. I'm plenty motivated.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.230
Oh?

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:08.730
I got my sights set on someone 
for a first kiss already.

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:13.170
I'm gonna find all these meat chunks 
or whatever for her.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:16.350
So, until the Gun Devil's dead, 
no smooching for me.

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.050
That's a hell of a thing 
to say in front of Aki!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:23.870
Besides, I learned something real important.

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:29.060
Sex stuff feels better when it's 
two people who get each other.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:33.380
I don't even know your name, 
so I ain't after your lips!

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:41.790
Then, if you kill the devil, Denji...

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:45.770
I'll give you a kiss... with tongue.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.280
Hey, hold it!

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:57.530
It's dangerous to run off solo! Stop!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:01.200
<b>th Floor</b>

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.020
Damn, I love teasing boys!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.170
Oh man, what are we gonna do?

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:05.790
I yearn for blood.

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.700
It's dangerous! You need to stop!

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:15.680
Himeno's been nice enough to train me 
for the last six months!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:18.840
If the alternative is letting 
some thug like you kiss her...

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:20.780
Then I'll take that kiss on the cheek!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:21.810
Move!

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.360
I don't want some dude 
all over me! It's nasty!

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.290
Say what?!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:29.190
Die! I'm after a way 
bigger goal than you, dude!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.190
I wish to join you!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.470
Shut up! I don't wanna hear that 
from someone newer than me!

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:34.090
What's your take on the rookies, Himeno?

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:34.090
Man, shut up!

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:35.540
More of this! Yes!

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:40.450
I'd say Arai's not super competent, 
but makes up for it in motivation.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.330
Get him, get him!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:44.380
Meanwhile, Kobeni's got the moves, 
but she's really timid.

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:48.920
You think any of the four rookies 
have a shot of surviving, Aki?

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.900
It's a duel to the death!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.750
You get the picture, now?

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:54.920
Most people either die 
or go private after a year,

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.530
regardless of how strong 
I thought they were.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.930
You are not kissing Himeno!

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.500
Asshole... I'm gonna kill you!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:02.180
That's not really an answer.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.180
Power... you're dead, too!

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:05.680
You too, shorty.

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:05.680
Don't die on me, Aki.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:06.630
But why?!

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:23.700
Himeno...

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:26.980
This is your new partner.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:31.190
He's rude, but I trained him 
to be of some use.

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:32.390
Try and get along.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:38.840
I'm Aki.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:40.720
Nice to meet you.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.420
Are you gonna be any help?

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:53.610
Well... I think so.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.760
You're gonna be my sixth partner.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.280
The others all died.

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:02.750
They all died because they were useless.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:08.160
Don't die on me, Aki.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:13.860
Gotta say, I'm not seeing 
any devils around here.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:18.610
Does that meat chunk of yours even work?

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:23.260
So tired...

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:24.320
Aki...

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.010
Incoming.

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:52.920
Got it.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:55.040
It floats?!

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:57.380
The battle is joined!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:09.580
Damnable devil! Did you see 
how it floated in fear of me?!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.720
No, no, that's my power.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.560
Say what?

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.220
I've got a contract with the Ghost Devil.

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:22.050
I served up my right eye in exchange 
for being able to use a ghost's right hand.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:26.910
My ghost hand's invisible 
and strong. Pretty slick, right?

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:31.240
How about it, Aki? 
Has he got any of the Gun's flesh?

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:34.580
No strong reaction. This isn't the one.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:38.030
I see... guess we better keep heading up.

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:44.650
Is it wise to blather on about 
your powers in my presence?

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.830
Are you people not meant to hold my reins?

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:50.950
Knowing about our powers makes 
for better teamwork, right?

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:54.260
Besides, I've got a few tricks 
up my sleeve, so I'm not worried.

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:56.210
Truly?

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:59.320
So what would you do if I said 
I was going to kill this one?

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.460
Put the weapon away.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:05.490
If you misbehave, 
I can always choke you to death.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:09.990
Can't... touch it...

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:19.060
I'd prefer if we got along. It's easier!

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:23.990
I will devour you in time!

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.260
You better not. I'm trying to get a kiss.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:30.690
Do you guys not get that the devil 
is still around? Can't you pipe...

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:35.770
Huh?

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:43.480
She does look like 
she'd be unpleasant raw.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:43.480
What is it?

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:45.800
